nPrefix P A D inst inst_1 inst_2 inst_3 inst_4 inst_5 cfg boundaries policy\n                  initial left right schedule))\n              (@Option.none.{0} (DefiKernel.Atomic.AbortReason P A D)) →\n            @Eq.{1} DefiKernel.Interleaving.Schedule suffix (@List.nil.{0} DefiKernel.Parallel.BranchId))))"}
