P01_INVENTORY {"axioms":["propext","Quot.sound"],"forbidden":[],"kind":"theorem","module":"DefiKernel.Typed.Authority","name":"DefiKernel.Typed.authorizesId_iff","statement":"∀ {Party Asset Domain : Type} [inst : DecidableEq.{1} Party] [inst_1 : DecidableEq.{1} Asset]\n  [inst_2 : DecidableEq.{1} Domain] (store : DefiKernel.Typed.CapabilityStore Party Asset Domain)\n  (ctx : DefiKernel.Typed.InvocationContext Party Domain) (operation : DefiKernel.Typed.OperationId)\n  (right : DefiKernel.Typed.Right Party Asset Domain) (id : DefiKernel.Typed.CapabilityId),\n  Iff\n    (@Eq.{1} Bool (@DefiKernel.Typed.authorizesId Party Asset Domain inst inst_1 inst_2 store ctx operation right id)\n      Bool.true)\n    (∃ cap,\n      And\n        (@Eq.{1} (Option.{0} (DefiKernel.Typed.Capability Party Asset Domain))\n          (@DefiKernel.Typed.CapabilityStore.lookup Party Asset Domain store id)\n          (@Option.some.{0} (DefiKernel.Typed.Capability Party Asset Domain) cap))\n        (And (@Eq.{1} Bool (@DefiKernel.Typed.Capability.live Party Asset Domain cap) Bool.true)\n          (And\n            (@Eq.{1} Party\n              (@DefiKernel.Typed.Grant.holder Party Asset Domain\n                (@DefiKernel.Typed.Capability.toGrant Party Asset Domain cap))\n              (@DefiKernel.Typed.InvocationContext.principal Party Domain ctx))\n            (And\n              (@Eq.{1} Domain\n                (@DefiKernel.Typed.Grant.domain Party Asset Domain\n                  (@DefiKernel.Typed.Capability.toGrant Party Asset Domain cap))\n                (@DefiKernel.Typed.InvocationContext.domain Party Domain ctx))\n              (And\n                (@Eq.{1} DefiKernel.Typed.OperationId\n                  (@DefiKernel.Typed.Grant.operation Party Asset Domain\n                    (@DefiKernel.Typed.Capability.toGrant Party Asset Domain cap))\n                  operation)\n                (And\n                  (@Eq.{1} (DefiKernel.Typed.Right Party Asset Domain)\n                  