              (@DefiKernel.Atomic.Policy.participants P A D policy))))\n            (@DefiKernel.Typed.State.balance P A D (@DefiKernel.Typed.ExecutionResult.state P A D initial)\n              (@DefiKernel.Atomic.Lane.cell P A D lane))"}
